{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows leucovorin calcium posted 2012-01-01; supply for the 50 mg/5 mL vial traces to Sagent Pharmaceuticals (SAGENT PHARMS) and the 350 mg/17.5 mL vial traces to Hikma with API from Cerbios-Pharma SA (VAI 2024-03-07) and manufacture at West-Ward Columbus Inc. (NAI 2026-04-30)",
  "headline_cites": ["D8", "E7", "E17", "E9", "E15"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage database lists leucovorin calcium with a first posting date of 2012-01-01, which is the earliest date the database holds.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 50 mg/5 mL, 5 mL vial used at Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside carries NDC 25021081310 and is labeled by Sagent Pharmaceuticals with manufacture by SAGENT PHARMS.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E6", "E7", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 350 mg/17.5 mL, 17.5 mL vial used at Corvale East and Corvale General carries NDC 00143955201 and is labeled by Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. with API manufacture by Cerbios-Pharma SA (FEI 3002808250) and drug product manufacture by West-Ward Columbus Inc. (FEI 1510690).",
      "cites": ["E2", "E5", "E9", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected Cerbios-Pharma SA and classified it VAI on 2024-03-07, with the classification known to FDA by 2024-06-05.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected West-Ward Columbus Inc. most recently on 2026-04-30 and classified it NAI.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (FEI 1510690) received Warning Letters on 2009-03-30 and has a history of VAI inspections in 2011, 2014, and 2018.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The highest-ranked transfer option is to move 8 vials of the 50 mg/5 mL, 5 mL presentation from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East from 2.7 days to 5 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside retains about two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3", "D9"]
    }
  ]
}
